-- StrataKit — modular voxel figures, as a plugin (docs/plugins.md): parts
-- with typed mounts (StrataKit.Part, PartFile), builds as trees
-- (StrataKit.Build), assembly into a Strata.Rig (StrataKit.Assemble),
-- walking, treads and hover (StrataKit.Motion), and damage that carves parts,
-- breaks them off and settles them as rubble (StrataKit.Damage). It names no
-- game concept: parts, mounts, slots, sizes and numeric tags are the game's
-- words.
mod StrataKit do

  doc "The plugin's version."
  fn version() : String do "0.1.0" end
end
